{
    "title": "Daily Jigsaw Puzzles",
    "description": "Welcome to the world of beautiful puzzles! Here are thousands of free HD puzzles waiting for you to solve!\r\n\r\nWant to get rid of boredom and mess?\r\nCome to Daily Jigsaw Puzzles! Let's surf on the sea, ski on a snow mountain, paddle on a calm lake, enjoy the sunset, look up at the stars and experience the magnificent Milky Way.\r\nYou can also play and run in the sun with lovely pets, or share a delicious meal with family and friends, or visit various countries...\r\n\r\nA variety of photo categories, thousands of high quality HD pictures, and daily exclusive puzzles are waiting for you!\r\nLet's enter a bright and happy world together, evoking inner peace and relaxation.",
